# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
*.egg-info/

# Workspace runtime state: the portal database and its SQLite sidecars (the DB
# is `[portal] db` in the marker, `reportal.db` by default), the content-addressed
# uploaded binaries and the
# generated report sites.  Local state, never source.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
/binaries/
/reports/

# Agent scratch (throwaway probes, seeded e2e workspaces, captures)
.scratch/

# CI-only engine checkouts restored under the workspace, then symlinked to the
# sibling layout [tool.uv.sources] expects (.github/workflows/check.yml).
.ci/

# Build artifacts.  `dist/` covers both the wheel and the Vite SPA bundled into
# src/reportal/assets/dist/.  `src/reportal/manual/` is the mirrored docs tree
# `scripts/sync_packaged_docs.py` writes for the wheel (source of truth stays
# `docs/` + `CHANGELOG.md`).  `src/reportal/deploy/` is the mirrored systemd
# unit templates (`scripts/sync_packaged_deploy.py`; source of truth stays
# repository `deploy/`).
build/
dist/
src/reportal/manual/
src/reportal/deploy/
web/node_modules/

# Tool caches
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Coverage
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Environment / secrets (bun loads web/.env at build time)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
